Description: phase-coded 4x4 MIMO transceiver and web HUD for QuadRF
 Runs a phase-coded 4x4 MIMO TDD link across the four QuadRF antenna elements
 and serves live channel matrix, constellation, spectrum, and chat telemetry
 over WebSockets.
 .
 Includes the systemd service, desktop launcher, web application, and
 QuadRF control panel integration.
